  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help 3 750 rural children have a meal at school</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to provide food for lunch at 15 primary schools in rural area of Burkina Faso. Food is a very important factor in the child development and a very strong motivator to attend school. For many of the 3.750 children of those 15 schools, food is scares at home. The lunch program of rice, beans, oil and salt is essential for those kids.</narrative>
  </description>
